data/papers/
__pycache__/
.venv/
.DS_Store
CLAUDE.local.md
results/*mock*
# Console captures from backgrounded runs. The JSONL beside them is the
# evidence; these are just what scrolled past while it was collected.
results/**/*.log
.env
.env.*
# ...but the example carries names only, never values, and must be committed
# so a fresh clone (or a cloud session) knows what to set.
!.env.example
odd-number-notes*.json

# Agents occasionally write a helper to a Windows path that becomes a literal
# filename in the repo root. Three landed there on 2026-08-30, one of them a
# batch's label output. Ignored so the next one cannot be committed by accident.
C[:\uf03a]Users*

# The mentor's take-home text. Removed when this repo went public: a take-home
# prompt gets reused across candidates and should not sit beside a worked
# solution. Kept locally, path in CLAUDE.local.md.
notes/take-home/Model Forensics SPAR Take-home.md

# The MATS reading archive: 76 arXiv papers, six past applications shared in
# confidence, the mentor's posts, and the ledger that maps each link in the
# admissions document to its file. Copied from the application workspace so
# agents can read it in place, beside data/papers/ where the same rule already
# holds: raw sources stay local, the notes derived from them are committed.
# Only data/mats/README.md, which says how to restore it, is tracked.
data/mats/*
!data/mats/README.md
